# KrishiNiti Agronomic Recommendation Engine

Deterministic agronomic decision intelligence package written in Python. It evaluates soil, crop, growth stage, application history, weather, and prices to construct safety-critical fertilizer recommendations.

## Installation

```bash
cd packages/engine
pip install -e .
```

## Running Tests

```bash
pip install -e ".[dev]"
pytest
```
